<title>USA: Mass. Bay Authority $200 mln sale moved to June 18.</title>
<headline>Mass. Bay Authority $200 mln sale moved to June 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority has moved its $200 million general transportation system bond offering to June 18 from June 11.</p>
<p>The bond sale is competitive. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
